{
  "uid": "iris-model-overview",
  "title": "Iris inference · Model quality & drift signals (模型指标)",
  "description": "模型指标：预测分布 / 置信度 / 推理耗时 / 当前模型标识。回答「模型预测是否还可信」，漂移结论以 Evidently 批处理报告为准。",
  "tags": [
    "mlops",
    "model-metrics",
    "phase4"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "怎么读这块面板",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**模型指标 / Model metrics —— 回答「模型的预测还可不可信」。**\n\n数据来自服务内对推理函数的埋点（`model_*`），与系统指标是两套东西：\n\n- **预测类别分布**：某一类占比突然飙升/消失，往往意味着输入分布变了。\n- **置信度分位 / 低置信度占比**：模型「拿不准」的比例上升，是漂移的早期信号。\n- **纯推理耗时**：只含预处理+predict，和系统 P95 对比可判断慢在模型还是 HTTP 层。\n- **当前模型**：run_id / model_uuid / git_commit，用于把线上表现追回训练版本。\n\n⚠️ 这里的信号只能**提示**「输出看起来变了」。是否真的发生数据漂移、哪个特征漂移了多少，以 `monitoring/drift_check.py` 生成的 Evidently 报告为准（批处理，不是实时）。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "模型加载状态",
      "description": "1=已加载，0=降级（/health 返回 503）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "未加载",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "已加载",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "model_loaded",
          "legendFormat": "loaded",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "当前模型 (model_uuid)",
      "description": "服务正在使用的模型标识。切换 MODEL_URI 后这里会变。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "model_info",
          "legendFormat": "{{model_uuid}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "训练代码 commit",
      "description": "模型对应的 git commit（来自第一阶段记录的 run tag）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "model_info",
          "legendFormat": "{{git_commit}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "预测速率（按类别）",
      "description": "每个类别的预测条数/秒。类别结构突变是模型侧的早期信号。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "legend": {}
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (predicted_class) (rate(model_predictions_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{predicted_class}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "预测类别占比（最近 15 分钟）",
      "description": "与训练集的类别分布对比：偏离越大越可疑。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "values": [
            "value",
            "percent"
          ]
        },
        "pieType": "donut",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (predicted_class) (increase(model_predictions_total[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{predicted_class}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "预测置信度分位数",
      "description": "P50/P10/P05，取值 0~1。整体下移说明模型越来越拿不准。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "legend": {}
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(model_prediction_confidence_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.10, sum by (le) (rate(model_prediction_confidence_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P10",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.05, sum by (le) (rate(model_prediction_confidence_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P05",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "低置信度预测占比（<0.8）",
      "description": "置信度低于 0.8 的预测占比。持续上升就该跑一次漂移报告。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "legend": {}
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(model_prediction_confidence_bucket{le=\"0.8\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(model_prediction_confidence_count[5m])) or vector(0), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "占比",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "纯推理耗时 P95",
      "description": "只含预处理+推理，不含 HTTP 开销，单位 ms。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "legend": {}
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(model_inference_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "P95 推理",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "平均批大小",
      "description": "每次 /predict 携带的样本数均值。批量变大通常会同时抬高延迟。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "legend": {}
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PROMETHEUS"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(model_prediction_batch_size_sum[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(model_prediction_batch_size_count[5m])) or vector(0), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "平均批大小",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
